---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  props:  recentDrives / recentCharges / analytics (derived by the parent dashboard
            via useDriving/useCharging/useAnalytics) + distanceUnit / efficiencyUnit /
            toEfficiencyDisplay (useUnits) + currencySymbol / locale (useFormatting)
            → one RecentActivityUpdate snapshot pushed by a RecentActivitySource (P1/S8);
              RecentActivityProjection derives the three panels from it.
            → toEfficiencyDisplay is carried as a value-typed `efficiencyFactor`
              (Wh/km → Wh/{unit} multiplier: 1.609344 for mi, 1 for km — the web
              dashboard's converter), keeping the projection pure + testable.
  shell:  3× <GlassPanel className="p-5"> in a grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 /
            sm:grid-cols-2 layout
            → RecentActivityGlassPanel (Color.TS.surfaceGlass + TSRadius.lg +
              Color.TS.border stroke, TSSpacing.xl). Feed full-width; battery +
              performance side-by-side on a regular width, stacked on compact
              (horizontalSizeClass) — the same responsive intent, Apple-idiomatic.
  panel1: Activity Feed — Activity glyph + t('activity.title') + Link("/drives")
            t('activity.viewAll'); Timeline of recent drives+charges (slice 0..8) or
            EmptyState Clock + t('activity.empty')
            → RecentActivityFeedPanel: section title (waveform.path.ecg) + a Button
              (onViewAll callback, the host wires nav) + the rows or the empty.
            drive row: `${fmtNumber(convertDistanceFromSI(distance_m,unit),1)} ${unit}
              ${t('activity.drive')}` / `${floor(s/3600)}h ${fmtInt(floor((s%3600)/60))}m
              · ${start??'?'}% → ${end??'?'}%`, icon Route, color #00f0ff
              → driveItem(): title "10.0 mi drive", subtitle "1h 30m · 80% → 60%",
                glyph road.lanes, tint Color.TS.accent (cyan).
            charge row: `${fmtNumber(convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh'),1)} kWh
              ${t('activity.charged')}` / `${start}% → ${end}%${cost? · formatCurrency(cost,2):''}`,
              icon Zap, color #10b981
              → chargeItem(): title "31.4 kWh charged", subtitle "44% → 80% · $9.40"
                (omitted when cost nil), glyph bolt.fill, tint Color.TS.statusSuccess.
            sort: activityItems.sort((a,b)=>b.time-a.time) → sorted newest-first.
            relative time: formatTimeAgo ("Just now"/"{m}m ago"/"{h}h ago"/"{d}d ago",
              else formatDateShort) → RecentActivityFormat.timeAgo (number words via the
              localizer; %d format so non-en can reorder).
  panel2: Battery Trend — BatteryCharging glyph + t('battery.title'); AreaChartWrapper
            over end_soc_pct (`?? 50`), `.reverse()`, shown when length>1, else
            t('battery.empty')
            → RecentActivityBatteryPanel + RecentActivityBatteryChart (Swift Charts
              AreaMark gradient 0.3→0 + LineMark, 0–100 % y-axis, original index x tick
              [web `i`], selection tooltip). batteryTrend() maps+reverses, default 50.
  panel3: Fleet Performance — TrendingUp glyph + t('perf.title'); rows Total Drives (30d)
            {total_drives??0} / Charge Sessions {total_charging_sessions??0} / Total Cost
            <Currency total_cost precision=2 amber> / CO₂ Saved {fmtInt(energy_kwh*0.42)}
            kg emerald; + most_efficient_vehicle card (name + fmtInt(toEfficiencyDisplay
            (efficiency)) efficiencyUnit) on bg-neon-green/5
            → RecentActivityPerformancePanel: rows raw counts (web `{value}` — NOT
              grouped), currency(2dp, amber→statusWarning), CO₂ fmtInt+" kg"
              (emerald→statusSuccess), + RecentActivityEfficientCard (success-tinted).
  fmt:    fmtNumber(v,d)/safeNumber → number/safe (NumberFormatter .decimal, .halfUp,
            grouping, non-finite→0); fmtInt → int; <Currency> → currency (symbol+grouped,
            non-finite→'—'); convertDistanceFromSI/convertEnergyFromSI → distanceFromSI/
            energyKwhFromWh (÷1609.344 / ÷1000 / ÷1000); formatDateShort → dateShort
            (.dateTime.month(.abbreviated).day()).
  i18n:   13 web `t()` keys (activity.title|drive|charged|viewAll|empty, battery.title|
            empty, perf.title|drives|charges|cost|co2|mostEfficient) → RecentActivityStrings
            facade, table "RecentActivity". Symbols (%, →, ·, h, m, kWh, kg) are
            locale-neutral literals, exactly as the web builds them in template strings
            and as the QuickMetrics precedent treats "h"/"m"/"kWh".

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → RecentActivityLoading (three redacted TSSkeleton panels; reduce-motion safe)
  content  → the three panels, each with its own internal empty (feed empty / battery
             empty / performance zeros) — the web's own per-panel emptiness, never blank
  empty    → RecentActivityEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, web "…Start driving!" message)
             when the whole snapshot resolves with no drives/charges/analytics
  error    → RecentActivityError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + RecentActivityConnectivityBanner + ONE guarded
             auto-refresh (re-armed on return to live)
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached panels, no refetch
  (The web component itself only splits each panel content/empty; the loading/error/
   stale/offline envelope the parent dashboard owns is reproduced here so no state is a
   blank box. The chip + banner show ONLY when not live, keeping the healthy state as
   visually clean as the web source.)
a11y: container summary (surface label + feed-row count, or friendly empty); per-row
  VoiceOver "{title}, {subtitle}, {time}"; per-metric "{label}: {value}"; icons
  accessibilityHidden; reduce-motion animation gate (chart + fade); Dynamic Type via
  system fonts/tokens; minimumScaleFactor on value/label.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"RecentActivity") emitted once on appear.
binding: P1/S8 RecentActivitySource seam (production impl over the shared dashboard state
  holders + useFormatting/useUnits prefs); the view performs NO networking.
  Previews/tests drive InMemoryRecentActivitySource.

